#. <CLT 4>赤い扉の向こうでは、
#. モノクマの号令を聞いたみんなが集まっていた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Everyone had heard Monokuma's proclamation, and they\n"
"were gathered by the red door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、その場に全員が揃った直後…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And as soon as we were all there...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. こんちゃっす！x２
msgctxt "0003 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hello! (Hello...! Hello...)"
msgstr ""

#. 増えたッ！？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "He's multiplied!?"
msgstr ""

#. 増えたのではない…増えたように見えるのは、
#. それ、すなわち幻なり…
msgctxt "0005 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Nope, not multiplication! It just looks that way cuz\n"
"of an illuu~~usion!"
msgstr ""

#. 高速移動を繰り返す事による残像現象を利用し、
#. 分身したように見せかけているのだッ！
msgctxt "0006 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I'm moving so fast it only LOOKS like I've multiplied!"
msgstr ""

#. クックック…どちらのモノクマが実体か…
#. オマエラにはわかるかな？
msgctxt "0007 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Ke-heh-heh... Can you guys tell...which one is the\n"
"real Monokuma!?"
msgstr ""

#. もうエレベーターに乗っていいのかしら？
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Can we just get on the elevator already?"
msgstr ""

#. ノリ悪いなぁ！x２
msgctxt "0009 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "You're not playing along! (Along...! Along...)"
msgstr ""

#. お前に付き合う気などない…！
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "We're not here to play with you!"
msgstr ""

#. はーい、わかったよぉ…
msgctxt "0011 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Okay, okay, fine!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、みんな揃ったんなら、
#. エレベーターにどうぞ。
msgctxt "0012 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Then if everyone's here and ready to go, please board\n"
"the pain train! Er...elevator."
msgstr ""

#. ボクは一足先に行ってるからね～！
msgctxt "0013 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I'll see you guys down there!"
msgstr ""

#. では行くか…
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Okay then, shall we?"
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと待って…！
#. まだ…心の準備が…ッ！
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "H-Hold on! I'm not mentally prepared yet...!"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠…もう逃げらんないんだからね…
#. 罪は償ってもらうよ…
msgctxt "0016 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You'll NEVER be mentally prepared! You can't run away\n"
"anymore, Hiro. You're gonna pay for your sins..."
msgstr ""

#. だから…犯人じゃねーってのに…！
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I told you already, I didn't do it! For SERIOUS!"
msgstr ""

#. そう言えば、別の衣装とやらは見つかったのですか？
#. それに、メモとやらは？
msgctxt "0018 | CELES"
msgid ""
"That reminds me... Did you ever find the other\n"
"costume? Or the note?"
msgstr ""

#. いや…それは…見つからんかったけども…
msgctxt "0019 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Um, well...no, but—"
msgstr ""

#. 残念でしたわね…
#. これで犯人は決まったようなものですわ。
msgctxt "0020 | CELES"
msgid ""
"How unfortunate. Then it would seem we have our\n"
"culprit."
msgstr ""

#. う…うぅッ…！
msgctxt "0021 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "N...ngh!"
msgstr ""

#. それは、ここで話す事じゃないわ。
#. 議論は裁判場に行ってからのはずよ…
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"This isn't the place to talk about it. Save your\n"
"accusations for when we get to the courtroom."
msgstr ""

#. そうだな、まずは裁判場に行くとしよう。
#. 話はそれからだ…
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"She's right. Let's get down there first. Then the\n"
"story can really begin..."
msgstr ""

#. うん…そうだね…
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, good idea."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's right...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やらなくちゃ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やらなくちゃ…いけないんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to...do it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クンと石丸クンを殺した犯人を
#. 放っておく訳にはいかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't let whoever killed Hifumi and Taka get away\n"
"with it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>残ったボクらの為にも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For everyone who's still alive...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、死んだ２人の為にも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...and for the two that lost their lives.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クンと石丸クンを殺した犯人…
#. ２人の仲間を殺した犯人…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The one who killed Hifumi and Taka... The one who\n"
"killed two of our friends...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その犯人は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The killer is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…この中にいる！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...someone right here!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 聞こえなかったのか？
#. 議論は裁判場に行ってからだ…
msgctxt "0034 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Were you listening? Wait till we get to the courtroom\n"
"to begin your arguing."
msgstr ""

#. うぅッ…！
#. 俺じゃねーんだべ…信じてくれ…
msgctxt "0035 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Nng...! It wasn't me! You gotta believe me!"
msgstr ""

#. 話は…裁判場に行ってからよ…
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The story begins when we get down there."
msgstr ""

#. 早く行こう！
#. 葉隠に…罪を償わせるんだからッ！
msgctxt "0037 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Let's hurry up and go, so we can make Hiro pay for his\n"
"crimes!"
msgstr ""

#. ほーらァ、とっとと行きましょ、
#. まこちん！
msgctxt "0038 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Come on, Big Mac! Let's do it!"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマのあの態度…
#. とことん…ふざけているな…
msgctxt "0039 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I don't like Monokuma's carefree attitude..."
msgstr ""

#. これで犯人は決まったようなもの。
msgctxt "0040 | CELES"
msgid "It would appear the culprit has been confirmed."
msgstr ""

#. 今回の裁判は、
#. あっという間に終わってしまいますわね。
msgctxt "0041 | CELES"
msgid "This trial will be over in no time."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はこんなモニターを気にしている場合じゃない…
#. これからの事に集中しよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't think about the monitor right now. I need to\n"
"concentrate on what's about to happen...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はこんな物を気にしている場合じゃない。
#. これからの事に集中しよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't think about the surveillance camera right now.\n"
"I need to concentrate on what's about to happen...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、肺の奥から大きな息を吐き出し…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I took one last deep breath, and exhaled slowly.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>エレベーターに向かって歩き出した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I began to walk toward the elevator.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、メンバー全員が、
#. エレベーターに乗り込んだところで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once everyone was aboard...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>エレベーターの扉は自動で閉まり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the doors closed on their own.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、動き出した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the steel box began to move.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ゴウン、ゴウン…という音と共に、
#. ボクらは深く深く落ちていく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The clunking of the elevator kept us company as we\n"
"fell further and further down...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう、後戻りは出来ない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was no going back...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すべての決着を付けない限り、
#. ボクらはもう戻れない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Until we settled all this, we couldn't go anywhere.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しばらくした後、
#. ようやくエレベーターは下降をやめ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm not sure how long it was before the elevator\n"
"finally came to a stop.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして扉が開く…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The elevator doors slid open...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>残酷な運命の扉が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...opening up onto a cruel fate.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>逃げる事は…出来ない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no escape for any of us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
